{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">NUM-ALIASES function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310138","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/NUM-ALIASES-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/NUM-ALIASES-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"NUM-ALIASES-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">NUM-ALIASES function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"NUM-ALIASES-function__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns an INTEGER value that represents the number\nof aliases defined. The NUM-ALIASES function uses no arguments. </p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"NUM-ALIASES-function__syntax_GC19WF2697690\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d97777e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"NUM-ALIASES-function__idGDM2OD2673074\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>NUM-ALIASES</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"NUM-ALIASES-function__example_GC19WG2697694\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d97777e122\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">This\nprocedure displays the number of defined aliases. It also displays\nthe aliases and logical database names of all connected databases.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-numal.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"NUM-ALIASES-function__idGDM2OE2673078\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DEFINE VARIABLE ix AS INTEGER NO-UNDO.\n\nDISPLAY <strong class=\"ph b\">NUM-ALIASES</strong> LABEL &quot;Number of Defined Aliases:&quot;.\nREPEAT ix = 1 TO <strong class=\"ph b\">NUM-ALIASES:</strong>\n  DISPLAY ALIAS(ix) LABEL &quot;Aliases&quot; \n    LDBNAME(ALIAS(ix)) LABEL &quot;Logical Database&quot;.\nEND.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"NUM-ALIASES-function__see-also_GC19WH2697701\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d97777e163\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ALIAS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ALIAS-function.html\">ALIAS function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CONNECT-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CONNECT-statement.html\">CONNECT statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CONNECTED-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CONNECTED-function.html\">CONNECTED function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CREATE-ALIAS-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CREATE-ALIAS-statement.html\">CREATE ALIAS statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CREATE-CALL-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CREATE-CALL-statement.html\">CREATE CALL statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DATASERVERS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DATASERVERS-function.html\">DATASERVERS function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DBRESTRICTIONS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DBRESTRICTIONS-function.html\">DBRESTRICTIONS function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DBTYPE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DBTYPE-function.html\">DBTYPE function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DBVERSION-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DBVERSION-function.html\">DBVERSION function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DELETE-ALIAS-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DELETE-ALIAS-statement.html\">DELETE ALIAS statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DISCONNECT-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DISCONNECT-statement.html\">DISCONNECT statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"FRAME-DB-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/FRAME-DB-function.html\">FRAME-DB function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LDBNAME-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LDBNAME-function.html\">LDBNAME function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"NUM-DBS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/NUM-DBS-function.html\">NUM-DBS function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PDBNAME-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PDBNAME-function.html\">PDBNAME function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"SDBNAME-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/SDBNAME-function.html\">SDBNAME function</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"NOW-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/NOW-function.html\">NOW function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"NUM-DBS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/NUM-DBS-function.html\">NUM-DBS function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310138","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"]